2 CONT =[https://www.geni.com/people/Biskop-Peder-Winstrup/6000000003421222325 Bisop Peder Winstrup] H3b7 (mtDNA) ; R1b-Z209>R1b1a1b1a1a2a1a1a1~-BY54766 (Y-DNA)  
