1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Peder Pedersen Winstrup (who is also known to have used the noble name, Himmelstierna). He was born c. 1647 and enrolled, 17 years old, at the Leiden University in 1664 as Petrus Wynstrupius Londa-Scanorum (Möller
2 CONC , 1991). Military matters were of more concern to Peder junior than theological ones, and while in Holland he studied fortification. He married, at latest in 1679, with Dorothea Sparre, acquiring the estate Södertou from his late 
2 CONC father in-law the same year."
