1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Forældre: provincialmedicus i Skåne Niels F. (1588-1645) og Karen Jacobsen (død 1664). Gift 16.9.1677 i Ålborg med Barbara Rosenberg, født 1662 i Thisted, begr. 14.10.1734 i Kbh. (Frue), d. af ridefoged til Ørum slot, tolder i Thi
2 CONC sted Peder Madsen (ca.1615-70, gift 1. gang 1646 med Barbara Rosenberg, død 1660) og Margrethe Brønsdorph (1630-75). – Bror til Christian F., Jens F. og Matthias F.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT TRANSLATION of ABOVE: "Parents: Provincialmedicus in Scania Niels F. (1588-1645) and Karen Jacobsen (d. 1664). Married 16.9.1677 in Ålborg with Barbara Rosenberg, born 1662 in Thisted, justifies. 14.10.1734 in Copenhagen (Ma'am), 
2 CONC d. of Ridefoged to the castle, the customs official in Thisted Peder Madsen (c. 1615-70, married 1st time 1646 with Barbara Rosenberg, died 1660) and Margrethe Brønsdorph (1630-75). – Brother to Christian F., Jens F. and Matthias 
2 CONC F."
2 CONT
2 CONT Not sure what the text has to do with the profile. The parents listed are "Mads Jacobsen Wedel" and "Ingeborg Johanne Jensdatter Ægidius"
