2 CONC  dam Agnes Fraser, daughter to the Lord Fraser, with whom he got the lands of Pitsligo, in marriage, who did bear to him Sr Alexander Forbes.
2 CONT # https://www.genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00478994&tree=LEO cites
