2 CONT http://jakobmjensen.dk/family/wordpress/?page_id=47
2 CONT
2 CONT Ernst Polycarpussen Caspar Hartmann, 1708 - 1796, priest in Randlev. It was his parsonage, which was burned by the fire in St. Steensen Blicher s "A Murder Burns History". He has described himself moving the fire on the first page
2 CONC  of Randlev parish where Blicher have known the story since he was a priest sst. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a large landowner and known as a "hard man". 
2 CONT
2 CONT Polycarpus Hartmann, 1668 - 1717, vicar of Kalle Garden. 
2 CONT
