1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Det ser ud som om, at Gottlieb Korn har været gift 2 gange. Det har han ikke. Hans kone er døbt Sitzel Maria Krog. Og ikke Cæcilia...Godt være Sitzel og Cæcilia er  samme person. Men hedder altså Sitzel ifølge Kirk
2 CONC ebogen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Til ydcrligere Sikring mod Ildsvaade fik Byen om ved 1748') ogsaa en fast Skorstensfejer. Hidtil havde man hjtrlpet sig mcd Natmanden i Bjerre uden dog at 1'ole sig vel betjent, men nu hom den udlmrte Skorstensfejer Gottlieb Korn 
2 CONC fra Kobenhavn, der arbejdede til enhvers Fornojelse og havde ,vist sigfrerdige at springe i en anstuhhen Skolsten til at nedrive og nrest Gud at soge dzrmpgl Iltlen derio. Iior sin F artlighed shulde han af Ilrandkassen aarlig hav
2 CONC e 20 Rdlr. sarnt 12 Sk. fbr hver 2 Lofts Shorsten og 6 Sk. for hver 1 Lofts Sliorsten at udrede af Beboerne. Blantlkassen fih altsaa ingen storle Ilyrde, og tlen bler, eltcrhaanden en eftcr fidens I-cjtighed meget fed I(asse (Aar 
2 CONC 1741 I(assebeholdning 1381t Rdlr. 2 \{h. 15r/, Sh.). Om det var deure Iiedme, der bevirkede, at Skomagerlavet ikkc hunde lbrmaas til at indbctale en Nlullit paa 5 Slrlr., er dog ihke sikkcrt. 1731, ,3. og 9. November2) har,dc Lave
2 CONC ts Flt,tning nemlig fundet Sted undel umaadclig Sliyden, mens Sl<omager.ne bedvrede, at tlet ilike med Sandhed kunde siges, ,at en eller llcre af vores Lavsbrodre vcd vores Lavs trlytning enten sclv haver sl<ydt eller vores Folhn.
2 CONC  Forst 5 Aar cfter, i 1736), endtes Sagen med 1 Rdlr. til de fattige, men intet til Brandl<assen.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===========================================================
2 CONT
2 CONT It appears that Gottlieb Korn has been married twice. He doesn't have that. His wife is named Sitzel Maria Krog. And not Cæcilia...Well Sitzel and Cæcilia are the same person. But it is called Sitzel according to the Kirkebogen.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1748, the town also had a fixed chimney sweep for further protection against fire. Up until now, people had helped themselves to the Nightman in Bjerre without, however, feeling well served, but now the famous chimney sweeper G
2 CONC ottlieb Korn from Copenhagen, who worked for everyone's enjoyment and had shown himself ready to jump at an incitement to demolish and nrest God to seek dzrmpgl Iltlen derio. For his courtesy, he should have 20 Rdlr annually from 
2 CONC the Ilrandkassen. sarnt 12 Sk. fbr each 2 Lofts Shorsten and 6 Sk. for every 1 Loft Sliorsten to be cleared by the Residents. The inner box therefore has no large volume, and the lid is, in any case, very fat (Year 1741 in (asse h
2 CONC olding 1381t Rdlr. 2 \{h. 15r/, Sh.) which resulted in the Shoemaker's Craft not being forced to pay a price of 5 Slrlr., is not certain. 1731, 3 and 9 November2) the movement of the Craft has indeed taken place under immense wear
2 CONC  and tear, while Sl< The omagers lamented that it could be said, with truth, that one or more of our Law's brothers had disobeyed our Law's obedience either by having sl<yd or by our followers. Only 5 years later, in 1736), the ca
2 CONC se ended with 1 Rdlr. to the poor, but nothing to Brandl<assen.
2 CONT
