2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Michel Christiansen WIBE
2 CONT
2 CONT 1565 - 30 Mar 1624
2 CONT
2 CONT     * RESIDENCE: Handelsborger
2 CONT
2 CONT     * OCCUPATION: Borgermester i København
2 CONT
2 CONT     * BIRTH: 1565, Legaard, Holstebro, Jylland, Danmark
