2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Hans Karise
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Arnold Karise
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Christian Albert Karise
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Immanuel Sunge Karise
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Bodil Karise.
2 CONT
