1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I Aug. 1654 døde begge Forældrene af Pest 9, og den lille Datter Sidsel (dvs. Cæcilie) blev  sendt til Aarhus, hvor hun opdroges af sin Tante, Maren Clemensdatter, der var gift med Borgmester  Anders Lydichsen. Den
2 CONC  9. Juni 1662 blev hun trolovet med Ridefoged paa Kalø Jesper  Nielsen Hutfeldt og den 3. Maj 1663 højtideligholdtes hendes Bryllup paa Raadhuset »i en anselig  adelig, gejstlig og verdslig Overværelse«, som det hedder i Datidens 
2 CONC Sprog. http://www.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~dnkcen/hhj/aarhus_storborgerslaegter.txt ___
2 CONT
2 CONT http://krogsgaard.name/pafg2158.htm#46978
2 CONT
2 CONT Christen Clementin Clemensen [Parents] was born in 1596. He died on 9 Sep 1654 in Næstved. He married Mette Matthiasdatter Iacobæa. Christen was employed as Forstander, Herlufsholm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mette Matthiasdatter Iacobæa was born in 1609. She was buried on 13 Aug 1654 in Næstved. She married Christen Clementin Clemensen.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	i 	Jacob Christensen Clementin was born in Oct 1638. He died in 1711. He was buried on 24 Jan 1711 in Hvorslev, Houlbjerg. Jacob was employed as Cand.theol., Sognepræst til Hvorslev.
2 CONT       		M 	ii 	Clemen Christensen Clementin was born about 1635. He died on 6 Oct 1680 in Sæby, Løve. Clemen was employed as Cand.theol., Sognepræst til Sæby.
2 CONT       		M 	iii 	Jens Christensen Clementin was born about 1636. He died in 1657.
2 CONT       		M 	iv 	Oluf Christensen Clementin was born on 4 Aug 1638 in Herlufsholm Gods, Næstved. He died on 16 Mar 1712. Oluf was employed as Cand.theol., Sognepræst til Koldby.
2 CONT       		F 	v 	Sidsel Christensdatter Clementin was born on 8 Jan 1643. She died on 16 Sep 1713.
2 CONT       		M 	vi 	Niels Christensen Clementin was born in 1645. He was buried on 13 Aug 1654 in Næstved.
2 CONT       		M 	vii 	Ivar Christensen Clementin was born in 1647. He was buried on 14 Aug 1654 in Næstved. 
