1 OCCU Major, chef for et Kompagni på Biellerup Ladegård, St. Mortens østre Landdistrikt, Støvring Herred, 
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hans skifte findes i Koldinghus Rytterdistrikt Skifteprotol 1758-1762 (se folio 718-719) og 1762-1764 (se folio 2-9). Boet fordelt således: sønnerne Cornet [Hieronymus Peter] Moldrup 1038 Rd., junker Ove Moldrup 10
2 CONC 79 Rd, Peder Moldrup g.m. datteren Mette Marie Lucie Moldrup 449 Rd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 20 Aug 1710 Vestervig Kloster, Vestervig parish, Thisted county, Jutland, Denmark. Joined the Danish Army 7 Aug 1730, ennobled 26 Jun 1731. Captain 1736, Major 1749, retired from the army 1754. Owner of the manor house Brandt
2 CONC lund in Vejle county. Died at Brandlund 25 Feb 1762. Mar 29 1737 he married the Danish noblewoman, Catherina Elisabeth de la Mare (1714-1748), daughter of Hieronymus de la Mare (1660-1727), officer and landowner, and Lucie Emmeren
2 CONC tia von Brockdorff (c.1692-1736). 
