1 NAME Elizabeth “Margaret” /Kennedy of Dunure/
2 GIVN Elizabeth “Margaret”
2 SURN Kennedy of Dunure
2 _MARNM Kennedy of Dunure
2 NICK Elizabeth Kennedy
2 NICK Elisabeth
2 NICK Margaret Kennedy Dunnure
2 NICK Margaretha Kennedie
