1 NAME Alaster "Cam" /Forbes/ 1st of Brux
2 GIVN Alaster "Cam"
2 SURN Forbes
2 NSFX 1st of Brux
2 _MARNM Forbes
2 NICK Glyed Alester
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1378
2 PLAC Forbes, Aberdeenshire, Scotland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1466
2 PLAC Forbes, Aberdeenshire, Scotland
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From [http://books.google.com/books?pg=PA237&lpg=PA237&dq=John+Forbes+of+brux+the+white+laird&sig=otRpdiigjwpqQwXllVlvt9JoMgk&ei=Y0KIUr2oAafO2gWHi4CQBw&id=YbrgAAAAMAAJ&ots=HR5sMVA8gP&output=text Publications, Volum
2 CONC e 34] By Scottish History Society.  Page 236
2 CONT
2 CONT The Genealogie of Sir John Forbes with the Black Lipp his 4th Son who was Alester Came Forbes or Glyed Alester The first of the House of Brux.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alester Came Forbes or Glyed Alester Being persecuted by the EarL of Marr for Killing Abergeldie Mouat was Reduced to Straits, but at last obtaining the Earls kindness he gave him in Marriage the Daughter of Sir Hugh Cameron of Br
2 CONC ux of which She was Heretrix with the Davoch of Glencona & Glencairne. She bear to him Arthur, John and Duncan of Drumalachie.
2 CONT
