1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Else Resen, who was born around 1686, belonged to
2 CONT
2 CONT this Norwegian branch of the family tree." (Solberg, O.) Else was the daughter of
2 CONT
2 CONT merchant Lars Christiansen and Gjertrud Larsdatter Resen of Fredrikshald (now
2 CONT
2 CONT Halden), although the Resen family lived mainly on the southern Norwegian coast. Else
2 CONT
2 CONT was one of thirteen children, three sons and ten daughters. Most of her siblings
2 CONT
2 CONT remained in Kristiansand. Else was named at the Oddernes church outside of
2 CONT
2 CONT Kristiansand in 1714, 1715, and 1716 as a baptismal sponsor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Funeral - Church book for Mo prgj. (Parish) - (2. påskedag Mo) https://urn.digitalarkivet.no/URN:NBN:no-a1450-kb20061214340177.jpg
