1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Ulrica Hedevig von Heinen, 4''' was born on January 12, 1734. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836777 Ulrich Frederik von Heinen, til Ulriksholm] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836780 Catharine Brügmann]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ulrica married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836549 Peder Rosenørn]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836849 Mette Rosenørn]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836778 Poul Pedersen Rosenørn]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-115644784 Ulrikke Frederikke Cathrine Rosenørn]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836766 Margrethe Benedikte Rosenørn]; 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-31836769 Johanne Caspara Pedersdatter Rosenørn]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on March 7, 1772 in Aarhus, Danmark and was buried on March 31, 1772 in Aalsø Kirkegård. 
2 CONT ----
